# Hospital Visit Scheduling and Tracking System

## ER Diagram

![ER Diagram](images/ER_Diagram.png)

### Entity Relationships

- One Patient can book many Appointments.
- One Doctor can handle many Appointments.
- Each Appointment generates one Visit Tracking record.
- One Visit Tracking record can contain multiple Prescriptions.
- Admin manages Patients, Doctors, and Appointments.

## Database Entities

### Patient
- patient_id (PK)
- name
- age
- gender
- phone
- email
- password

### Doctor
- doctor_id (PK)
- doctor_name
- specialization
- qualification
- experience
- phone
- email

### Appointment
- appointment_id (PK)
- patient_id (FK)
- doctor_id (FK)
- appointment_date
- appointment_time
- status

### Visit Tracking
- visit_id (PK)
- appointment_id (FK)
- check_in_time
- consultation_start
- consultation_end
- check_out_time

### Prescription
- prescription_id (PK)
- visit_id (FK)
- medicine_name
- dosage
- duration
- instructions
